<section id="A11" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix K </span>Algorithm for device placement</h2>

<div id="A11.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A11.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Algorithm <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ Appendix K Algorithm for device placement" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> walks through the full pseudo code of the network-aware device placement algorithm.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A11.F11" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2603.06798v1/batch_512.png" id="A11.F11.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:1345/345;" width="1345" height="345" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 11: </span>Throughput improvement relative to manual strategy with microbatch size 1 across different parallelization strategies. “X” indicates cases where the baseline fails to find a feasible placement within memory constraints. Llama2-7B and Llama3-70B are realizable only up to batch size 4 and 2 respectively due to high memory requirements.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_figure ltx_float_algorithm ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_middle ltx_framed ltx_framed_top" style="width:463.4pt;">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="alg1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span> Device Placement Optimization with Latency and Memory Considerations</figcaption>
<div id="alg1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.l0" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">0:</span>
            
            
           Layerwise latency/memory estimates, Architecture &amp; Network configs

</div>
<div id="alg1.l0a" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">0:</span>
            
            
           Device placement, <math id="alg1.l0a.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{\text{batch}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>batch</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{\text{batch}}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">1:</span>
            
            
           <span id="alg1.l1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Init:</span> <math id="alg1.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="dp[\ell][id][k][s]\leftarrow(\infty,\emptyset)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">dp[\ell][id][k][s]\leftarrow(\infty,\emptyset)</annotation></semantics></math>  <span id="alg1.l1.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;">// dp[level][downset][accelerators][stages]</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">2:</span>
            
            
           <math id="alg1.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="dp[\ell][\emptyset][*][0]\leftarrow(0,\text{init})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mtext>init</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">dp[\ell][\emptyset][*][0]\leftarrow(0,\text{init})</annotation></semantics></math>  <span id="alg1.l2.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;">// Base case: no layers assigned</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">3:</span>
            
            
           <span id="alg1.l3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="alg1.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="id\in\mathit{Downsets}\setminus\{D_{\text{full}}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mi>𝐷𝑜𝑤𝑛𝑠𝑒𝑡𝑠</mi><mo>∖</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>full</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">id\in\mathit{Downsets}\setminus\{D_{\text{full}}\}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg1.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">4:</span>
            
            
            <math id="alg1.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathit{isZeRO}\leftarrow\textsc{IsZeroMemory}(\textsc{LayerMemReq}(id))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝑖𝑠𝑍𝑒𝑅𝑂</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">IsZeroMemory</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">LayerMemReq</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathit{isZeRO}\leftarrow\textsc{IsZeroMemory}(\textsc{LayerMemReq}(id))</annotation></semantics></math>  <span id="alg1.l4.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;">// ZeRO opt. if applicable</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">5:</span>
            
            
            <span id="alg1.l5.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="alg1.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathit{subId}\subset id,\ \mathit{load}\leftarrow id\setminus\mathit{subId}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝑠𝑢𝑏𝐼𝑑</mi><mo>⊂</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.667em">,</mo><mrow><mi>𝑙𝑜𝑎𝑑</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo>∖</mo><mi>𝑠𝑢𝑏𝐼𝑑</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathit{subId}\subset id,\ \mathit{load}\leftarrow id\setminus\mathit{subId}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg1.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">6:</span>
            
            
             <math id="alg1.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathit{loads}\leftarrow\textsc{GetLoadOfStage}(\mathit{load},\mathit{isZeRO})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝑙𝑜𝑎𝑑𝑠</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">GetLoadOfStage</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝑙𝑜𝑎𝑑</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝑖𝑠𝑍𝑒𝑅𝑂</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathit{loads}\leftarrow\textsc{GetLoadOfStage}(\mathit{load},\mathit{isZeRO})</annotation></semantics></math>  <span id="alg1.l6.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;">// Latencies for all placements</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">7:</span>
            
            
             <span id="alg1.l7.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="alg1.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s\in[1,S_{\max}],\ k\in[1,K_{\max}],\ a\in\textsc{ValidAccelCounts}(\mathit{load})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>max</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.667em">,</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>max</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.667em">,</mo><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">ValidAccelCounts</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝑙𝑜𝑎𝑑</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s\in[1,S_{\max}],\ k\in[1,K_{\max}],\ a\in\textsc{ValidAccelCounts}(\mathit{load})</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l7.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg1.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">8:</span>
            
            
              <math id="alg1.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathit{prev}\leftarrow dp[\textsc{GetIdx}(\cdot)][\mathit{subId}][k{-}a][s{-}1]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝑝𝑟𝑒𝑣</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">GetIdx</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>𝑠𝑢𝑏𝐼𝑑</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathit{prev}\leftarrow dp[\textsc{GetIdx}(\cdot)][\mathit{subId}][k{-}a][s{-}1]</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">9:</span>
            
            
              <span id="alg1.l9.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> each level <math id="alg1.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l9.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg1.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">10:</span>
            
            
               <math id="alg1.l10.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="c\leftarrow\max(\mathit{prev}.\text{latency},\ \mathit{loads}[\ell][a].\text{latency})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi>max</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝑝𝑟𝑒𝑣</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">.</mo><mtext>latency</mtext><mo rspace="0.667em">,</mo><mi>𝑙𝑜𝑎𝑑𝑠</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">.</mo><mtext>latency</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c\leftarrow\max(\mathit{prev}.\text{latency},\ \mathit{loads}[\ell][a].\text{latency})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">11:</span>
            
            
               <span id="alg1.l11.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <math id="alg1.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c&lt;dp[\ell][id][k][s].\text{first}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">.</mo><mtext>first</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c&lt;dp[\ell][id][k][s].\text{first}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l11.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>



</div>
<div id="alg1.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">12:</span>
            
            
                <math id="alg1.l12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="dp[\ell][id][k][s].\text{first}\leftarrow c" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">.</mo><mrow><mtext>first</mtext><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">dp[\ell][id][k][s].\text{first}\leftarrow c</annotation></semantics></math>  <span id="alg1.l12.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;">// Update min-max latency</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">13:</span>
            
            
               <span id="alg1.l13.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l13.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">14:</span>
            
            
              <span id="alg1.l14.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l14.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l15" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">15:</span>
            
            
             <span id="alg1.l15.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l15.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l16" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">16:</span>
            
            
            <span id="alg1.l16.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l16.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l17" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">17:</span>
            
            
           <span id="alg1.l17.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l17.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l18" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">18:</span>
            
            
           <math id="alg1.l18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{\min}\leftarrow\infty" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>min</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{\min}\leftarrow\infty</annotation></semantics></math>  <span id="alg1.l18.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;">// Find best end-to-end batch time</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l19" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">19:</span>
            
            
           <span id="alg1.l19.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="alg1.l19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathit{subId}\subset D_{\text{full}},\ F\leftarrow D_{\text{full}}\setminus\mathit{subId}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝑠𝑢𝑏𝐼𝑑</mi><mo>⊂</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>full</mtext></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.667em">,</mo><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>full</mtext></msub><mo>∖</mo><mi>𝑠𝑢𝑏𝐼𝑑</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathit{subId}\subset D_{\text{full}},\ F\leftarrow D_{\text{full}}\setminus\mathit{subId}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l19.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg1.l20" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">20:</span>
            
            
            <math id="alg1.l20.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathit{load}\leftarrow\textsc{GetLoadOfStage}(F,\mathit{subId})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝑙𝑜𝑎𝑑</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">GetLoadOfStage</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝑠𝑢𝑏𝐼𝑑</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathit{load}\leftarrow\textsc{GetLoadOfStage}(F,\mathit{subId})</annotation></semantics></math>  <span id="alg1.l20.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;">// Latency for remaining layers</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l21" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">21:</span>
            
            
            <span id="alg1.l21.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="alg1.l21.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s\in[1,S_{\max}],\ k\in[1,K_{\max}],\ a\in\textsc{ValidAccelCounts}(F)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>max</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.667em">,</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>max</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.667em">,</mo><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">ValidAccelCounts</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s\in[1,S_{\max}],\ k\in[1,K_{\max}],\ a\in\textsc{ValidAccelCounts}(F)</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l21.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg1.l22" class="ltx_listingline">
